# robohub-transport Kconfig

menu "RoboHub transport"

config RH_TRANSPORT
    bool "Framed byte-stream transport"
    default n
    help
      COBS framing with a Fletcher-16 integrity check over a physical byte
      stream. A program that talks to a UART, a USB CDC pipe, an RS-485 bus or a
      socket selects it.

config RH_TRANSPORT_MAX_FRAME_SIZE
    int "Largest frame (bytes)"
    default 256
    help
      The largest COBS-encoded frame accepted or produced. The receive buffer is
      part of the transport instance, so this is what one channel costs.

endmenu
